# Define variables: the base address and port of the server
@BackendApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5263

### Test 1: Check health status (GET request)
GET {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------
# Note: ### is used to separate different requests, do not omit it

### Test 2: Send a chat message (POST request)
POST {{BackendApi_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello .NET, this is from HTTP file!"
}
